.
.  Generate sample output for Xbar control chart
.
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
set ipl1na duane.ps
device 2 postscript
.
SKIP 25
READ VANGEL5.DAT Y
.
TITLE AUTOMATIC
TITLE SIZE 3
LABEL CASE ASIS
.
DUANE PLOT Y
.
box 0 0 100 100
.
device 2 close
system cp DUANE.PS duane.ps
system rm DUANE.PS
.
quit
